{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/GIF.gif?t=1745045371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been assigned to a village on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train yourself and deploy units.<br>Make good use of dungeon mechanisms and protect the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this real-time tower defense game full of strategy and challenge, recruit unique combat units, use items, collect gear, and build your own defensive line to fend off waves of evil creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in its demo stage. The core gameplay framework is complete, and content is being added.<br>At present, your task is to defend the village for just <strong>5 days</strong> \u2014 survive all 5 days and protect the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're welcome to try it out, and we\u2019d love to hear your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback QQ: 519156452</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619780?t=1745045371","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619780?t=1745045371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/e0bf60e3a968783283315d2a9f9ea148da627bea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745045371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/e0bf60e3a968783283315d2a9f9ea148da627bea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745045371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3664420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/extras/GIF.gif?t=1745045371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been assigned to a village on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train yourself and deploy units.<br>Make good use of dungeon mechanisms and protect the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this real-time tower defense game full of strategy and challenge, recruit unique combat units, use items, collect gear, and build your own defensive line to fend off waves of evil creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in its demo stage. The core gameplay framework is complete, and content is being added.<br>At present, your task is to defend the village for just <strong>5 days</strong> \u2014 survive all 5 days and protect the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're welcome to try it out, and we\u2019d love to hear your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback QQ: 519156452</p>","developers":["\u6c34\u679c\u62fc\u76d8"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619780/88165ad4aafbb207d02e2dadd02d34fd5a428102/header.jpg?t=1745045371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120969,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120969/movie480.mp4?t=1744735167","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120969/movie_max.mp4?t=1744735167"},"name":"\u5b88\u536b\u5730\u4e0b\u57ce","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120969/26ecd6e016e82de40ca12af7958428a951580fbf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744735167","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120969/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744735167","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120969/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744735167"}}],"name":"Dungeon Guardians","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":